---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Neil Tayler Film"
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<h1>About Me</h1>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Neil. This blog is where I write about my interests and experiences.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm passionate about filmmaking, post-production, editing, and colour grading.
		When I'm not working on a project, you'll likely find me exploring photography
		or tinkering with new technology.
	</p>
	<p>
		Feel free to browse my writing and reach out if you'd like to connect!
	</p>
</Layout>
